# TableTool 1.0.1

Pure ISO C17 CLI typed table processing tool.

## Build

See BUILDING.md.

## Usage

```
tabletool --script script.tts --report report.txt
tabletool --help
tabletool --version
```

## Supported

- Formats: CSV, TSV, restricted Markdown
- Types: STRING, INTEGER, DECIMAL, BOOLEAN, DATE, URL, EAN13, CODE128
- Operations: LOAD, TYPE, column/row mutations, SORT, FIND, WRITE, BARCODE-=
SHEET
- UTF-8, Chinese search, stable sort, URL normalization, EAN-13, Code 128 B=
/C optimal, SVG barcodes

## Examples

See `examples/`.

## Tests

See `tests/` and `acceptance/` from the task pack.
EOF
